<title>CHINA: China's Jan-July palm oil buying detailed.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-July palm oil buying detailed.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table shows the palm oil import figures of five major Chinese customs offices as well as the country of origin during Jan-July 1996.</p>
<p>Details were provided by the General Administration of Customs of China.</p>
<p>Figures are in tonnes. Percentage represents the market share.</p>
<p>-----PALM OIL</p>
<p>July imports: 99,814	Jan-July total imports: 582,799</p>
<p>CUSTOMS		 July	   Pct	  Jan-July    Pct</p>
<p>Jiulong	     26,923	  27.0	  183,393    31.4</p>
<p>(Shenzhen) Haikou    994	   0.9	   64,021    11.0</p>
<p>Shanghai		  89	   0.08	  54,671     9.4</p>
<p>Nanjing		9,942	  10.0	   48,585     8.3</p>
<p>Tianjin	     13,302	  13.3	   45,933     7.9</p>
<p>ORIGINS</p>
<p>Malaysia	    84,907	  85.1	  431,196    74.0</p>
<p>Indonesia	   14,134	  14.1	   87,990    15.1</p>
